e risk of severe injury and mental trauma."},{"substance":"DOx","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"TripSit classification: Caution."},{"substance":"MAOIs","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"NBOMes","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"TripSit classification: Caution."},{"substance":"Pregabalin","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Caution should be given due to mescaline’s stimulating effects and pregabalin’s seizure concerns at higher dosages. Pregabalin may reduce the vasoconstriction, anxiety, and other side effects of mescaline. Additionally, Pregabalin may increase mescaline’s inhibition and risk of injury."},{"substance":"Dextromethorphan","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"DMT","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"Ketamine","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"LSD","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"MDMA","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"Mushrooms","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"MXE","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"Nitrous","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"PCP","status":"Synergy","tone":"info","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & Synergy."},{"substance":"Caffeine","status":"Low risk","tone":"positive","note":"High doses of caffeine are uncomfortable and this will be magnified by psychedelics"},{"substance":"Opioids","status":"Low risk","tone":"positive","note":"TripSit classification: Low Risk & No Synergy."},{"substance":"A